# Student photography. Source frames (163MB) and the cut-outs derived from them
# (36MB) stay out of history: they are large, they are regenerable with
# `cricket-posts cutout --input real-photo`, and photographs of identifiable
# children are not something to make permanent in a git history by default.
# The manifest is tracked, so the bank stays described and reproducible.
real-photo/
assets/subjects/*.png
